n\n\ngithub\tgit@github.com:Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A.git (fetch)\ngithub\tgit@github.com:Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A.git (push)\n.githooks\n/tmp/qpbt-uniform-affine-collision-20260909\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
