ba1f02bfc04`.\\n\\n## Findings\\n\\nCheckbox states: `[ ]` unresolved (blocks the merge), `[x]` resolved.\\nResolve a finding by ticking its box in this review body.\\n\\n<!-- findings:begin -->\\n<!-- no findings -->\\n<!-- findings:end -->\\n\\n## Code review\\n\\nReviewed the full canonical 3-file diff at the exact remote head. The coefficient evaluation agrees with `Polynomial.ofFn`, the root-count proof is valid for all degree bounds without a hidden `bound < q` assumption, and the affine evaluation theorem correctly uses nonzero direction to obtain a unique parameter. The resulting uniform collision bound matches the Schwartz-Zippel input at `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:950-955`.\\n\\nAll nine exact-head CI contexts remain green. Targeted axiom checks report only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`; no proof holes, bypasses, or source-hypothesis drift were found. The external `lean-conventions` skill was unavailable, so style and integrity were checked against `AGENTS.md` and the repository's checked-in convention documents.\\n\\nNative review binding: 567d52e2574a454486381380fdfd5e78 f15d0fc5721622360564b8083577dba1f02bfc04 6434dfe018898cf9632c96f8bc97ec4ca800fa3f1567de46bd2b6479b7b5d52f\\n\",\n  \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/443#pullrequestreview-5146285346\",\n  \"pull_request_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/443\",\n  \"author_association\": \"OWNER\",\n  \"_links\": {\n   \"html\": {\n    \"href\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/443#pullrequestreview-5146285346\"\n   },\n   \"pull_request\": {\n    \"href\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/443\"\n   }\n  },\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-08T19:46:10Z\",\n  \"commit_id\": \"f15d0fc5721622360564b8083577dba1f02bfc04\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": 5149891827,\n  \"node_id\": \"PRR_kwDOUJyJf88AAAABMvUc8w\",\n  \"user\": {\n   \"login\": \