.sound` in their axiom dependencies. Shell and changed Python files passed syntax checks.\\n\\nResidual limitations: `restrictedALineSeedEvent_positive` and `restrictedDLineSeedEvent_positive` remain unchanged, explicitly named proof obligations containing `sorry`; the checked results do not depend on them. Full builds and workflow runtime tests were not rerun. The external `lean-conventions` skill was unavailable; repository integrity and review rules were used. The complete patch supplemented the truncated attachment; telemetry contents were excluded as instructed.\\n\",\n  \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/443#pullrequestreview-5151425169\",\n  \"pull_request_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/443\",\n  \"author_association\": \"OWNER\",\n  \"_links\": {\n   \"html\": {\n    \"href\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/443#pullrequestreview-5151425169\"\n   },\n   \"pull_request\": {\n    \"href\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/443\"\n   }\n  },\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-09T08:02:13Z\",\n  \"commit_id\": \"f65619e04a209cafafaaa1a51610e0e6dfe9b361\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": 5153309450,\n  \"node_id\": \"PRR_kwDOUJyJf88AAAABMylDCg\",\n  \"user\": {\n   \"login\": \"Dengnifer\",\n   \"id\": 89234078,\n   \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4\",\n   \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?u=7a60297a751d9142f3705fd4d6c15e08cfe00d0f&v=4\",\n   \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer\",\n   \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer\",\n   \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers\",\n   \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}\",\n   \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}\",\n   \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n   \"subscripti